OL,3,AFBI reportedly investigating apparent
OL,4,Ahack of its criminal database
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe FBI is investigating an apparent
OL,7,Fbreach of its criminal information
OL,8,Fdatabase, US media report citing two
OL,9,Fpeople briefed on the issue.
OL,11,FThe National Crime Information Center
OL,12,F(NCIC) database is used by federal and
OL,13,Flocal law enforcement to share
OL,14,Finformation on warrants and background
OL,15,Fchecks. The BBC has contacted the FBI
OL,16,Ffor comment.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/39
